</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span> National Institute of Information and Communications Technology, Japan
</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span> The University of Osaka, Japan<sup id="id4" class="ltx_sup">*</sup><span id="id5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">matta@nlp.ist.i.kyoto-u.ac.jp</span>,
<span id="id6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">liskanashiro@nict.go.jp</span>
</span></span></span></span>
