<span id="S4.T1.2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">86.5 / 82.5</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.75pt 3.0pt;">
